---

<BaseLayout
  title="2026 黑五 Mac 软件折扣清单：只挑终身授权和高折扣 | MacAppHQ"
  description="2026 黑五与网络星期一 Mac 软件折扣清单，按效率、内容创作、AI、设计、系统、开发、财务分类，优先收录终身授权和 50% 以上折扣，已评测的软件附站内链接。"
  keywords="2026 黑五,Black Friday,Mac 软件折扣,终身授权,Mac App 优惠"
  canonical="/black-friday-2026"
  image="/media/black-friday-2026/og.jpg"
  ogType="website"
  structuredData={structuredData}
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="glass bf-page">
      <header class="bf-hero">
        <span class="bf-hero__eyebrow">Black Friday · 2026</span>
        <h1>2026 黑五 Mac 软件折扣清单</h1>
        <p class="bf-hero__lead">
          从公开整理的 Mac App 折扣里挑了 {total} 个，只保留终身授权和折扣力度较大的条目。
          已经完整评测过的软件，后面附了站内链接。
          <a class="bf-hero__submit" href="#submit">你是开发者？提交你的黑五折扣 →</a>
        </p>
        <div class="bf-hero__meta">
          <span>最后整理：2026.11.17</span>
          <span>共 {total} 个折扣</span>
          <span>
            来源：
            <a
              href="https://github.com/s1ntoneli/Awesome-Black-Friday-Cyber-Monday-for-Mac-Apps"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              GitHub 上的 Awesome Black Friday for Mac Apps
            </a>
          </span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <aside class="bf-note">
        <strong>购买前请核对。</strong>
        折扣、优惠码和起止日期由开发者自行提交，本站没有逐个下单验证。部分活动要等到 11 月下旬才生效，
        价格、可用地区和授权方式以官网结账页为准。上游清单中含少量赞助条目，本页只按折扣力度和授权类型筛选，未收取费用。
      </aside>

      <p class="bf-picked">
        已经写过完整评测的：
        <a href="/article/screensage-scenario-driven-recording-guide">ScreenSage Pro</a>、
        <a href="/article/zipic-for-mac">Zipic</a>、
        <a href="/article/wins">Wins</a>、
        <a href="/article/betterstage-for-mac">BetterStage</a>、
        <a href="/article/cleanclip-for-mac">CleanClip</a>。
      </p>

      <nav class="bf-toc" aria-label="折扣分类">
        {sections.map((section) => (
          <a href={`#${section.id}`}>
            {section.title}
            <span>{section.deals.length}</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </nav>

      {sections.map((section) => (
        <section class="bf-section" id={section.id}>
          <div class="bf-section__head">
            <h2>{section.title}</h2>
            {section.note ? <p>{section.note}</p> : null}
          </div>
          <div class="bf-grid">
            {section.deals.map((deal) => (
              <article class="bf-card">
                <div class="bf-card__top">
                  <span class={`bf-off ${deal.life ? "bf-off--life" : ""}`}>{deal.off}</span>
                  {deal.life ? <span class="bf-tag">终身授权</span> : null}
                </div>
                <h3 class="bf-card__name">
                  <a href={deal.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">
                    {deal.name}
                  </a>
                </h3>
                <p class="bf-card__type">{deal.type}</p>
                <p class="bf-card__desc">{deal.desc}</p>
                {deal.code ? (
                  <div class="bf-code-row">
                    <div class="bf-code-box">
                      <span class="bf-code-label">优惠码</span>
                      <code class="bf-code-value" title={deal.code}>{deal.code}</code>
                    </div>
                    <button class="bf-copy" type="button" data-copy={deal.code} aria-label={`复制优惠码 ${deal.code}`}>
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <rect x="9" y="9" width="12" height="12" rx="2"></rect>
                        <path d="M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10"></path>
                      </svg>
                      <span class="bf-copy__text">复制</span>
                    </button>
                  </div>
                ) : null}
                {deal.review ? (
                  <a class="bf-review" href={deal.review}>
                    看我们的评测 →
                  </a>
                ) : null}
                <div class="bf-card__foot">
                  {deal.price ? <span class="bf-price">{deal.price}</span> : null}
                  <span class="bf-dates">{deal.dates}</span>
                </div>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>
      ))}

      <footer class="bf-foot">
        <h2>怎么用这份清单</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>先看「终身授权」标记。订阅制的折扣只影响首年，续费会回到原价。</li>
          <li>优惠码有时间窗口，收藏本页后在下单前再确认一次日期。</li>
          <li>同一开发者的多个应用常有统一折扣，比如 Dock 系列共用同一个优惠码。</li>
          <li>不确定要不要买的，先看站内评测，再决定是否为一个折扣提前付费。</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="bf-submit" id="submit">
          <div class="bf-submit__copy">
            <h3>提交你的黑五折扣</h3>
            <p>
              如果你是开发者或发行方，想把折扣放进这份清单，直接发邮件给我们。收录免费，
              只收 Mac 应用，我们会先核对折扣是否真实有效，再决定是否列出。
            </p>
            <ul class="bf-submit__req">
              <li>应用名称与一句话介绍</li>
              <li>官网或购买页链接</li>
              <li>折扣力度与优惠码（没有码请注明）</li>
              <li>起止日期，以及是否终身授权</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <a class="bf-submit__btn" href={submitHref}>发邮件提交</a>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </article>
  </div>
<script>
  document.addEventListener("click", async (event) => {
    const target = event.target as HTMLElement | null;
    const button = target?.closest("[data-copy]") as HTMLButtonElement | null;
    if (!button) return;

    const code = button.dataset.copy ?? "";
    try {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(code);
    } catch {
      const helper = document.createElement("textarea");
      helper.value = code;
      document.body.appendChild(helper);
      helper.select();
      document.execCommand("copy");
      helper.remove();
    }

    const text = button.querySelector(".bf-copy__text");
    button.classList.add("is-copied");
    if (text) text.textContent = "已复制";
    window.setTimeout(() => {
      button.classList.remove("is-copied");
      if (text) text.textContent = "复制";
    }, 1600);
  });
</script>
</BaseLayout>

